rooms_desc ({"This is the Purification hall of Groovin, Student of Life.This room is sparse and simple, shaded with a subtle eleganceThat draws the mind together and the stills the soul. Youreye is pleased as it passes over a simple arrangement of a flowerand a twg, bending in the radiant sunlight that flows through the open windows framed in bamboo.You may purify yourself in the fresh-water spring in the entranceway.May you seek and find a peace in you which you cherish.","you have entered the training hall ofGroovin, Student of Life. It is here thatGroovin practices and hones his considerableproficiency in Aikido.At the front of the room is a portrait of O-sensei.The middle of the room is covered with tatami matswhere the active meditation of Aikido is practiced.This is a large room, accomidating about 121 tatami mats. The sunis shining brightly against the shoji screens brightening theroom in a soft, warm glow.May your mind be as clear as the beginner's.","This is your weapon's storage, idiot. You should know these things, it's your house.Sheesh!!!",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
