items ({({"spring","Here is a fresh-water spring. It's water is cool and clean. Here you may wash your head and mouth, a ceremony to remind yourself that now is the time to clean away troublesome thoughts and inconvient words. Now is the time to be calm and be centered and focused, yet relaxed and pliant. Now you test your soul. Clean or not as you choose, it may not be your thing.",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
